    "never players / non-mobs / bosses / elder guardians / wardens / giants / riders / leashed mobs / other people's pets", `cooldown >= ${CAPTURE_LIMITS.minCooldownTicks} ticks`,
    "a copied item releases at most once; an edited one never (SHA-256 of the snapshot per token)",
