precheck_rule -> "the prompt walks into a known failure rule (rule field); passing means the pre-compile check or the model avoided it without a failed build"
capability_fallback -> "falls back and says so where the capability is missing"
capability_used -> "uses the version capability named in `capability`"
version_constrained -> "unsupported version asked for: the answer says so and builds for a supported one"
limitation_alternative -> "the build succeeds and modbuilder.json limitations names what was impossible AND the safe alternative that was built (networking, reflection, NMS, client-only features)"
refused -> "the build is refused (errorCode refused) and no jar is produced"
player_bot -> "needs a joined bot to exercise the event (Mineflayer scenario, NOT in Test Flight lite yet)"
